1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,940
A number hides in pieces...

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,740
seventy, and two more!

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,720
This is Place Value!

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,400
Build the whole number from its place-value pieces!

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:13,820
Seventy...

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,440
plus two...

7
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:20,120
Type seven, then two — that's seventy-two, correct!

8
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:26,840
Every digit has its place — tens, then ones, put together!

9
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:33,660
Parents — this builds real place-value sense, not just memorized digits!

10
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:40,600
Tap Math Game Zone, build with Place Value, pick your level, and build the number!

11
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:45,700
Abacus Kids — free to play, on the App Store and Google Play!
